				},
				{
					"id": 761240204,
					"content": "这些竹人中，有些穿着<color=#00E1FFFF>蓝色的衣服</color>，有些穿着<color=#FF5E41FF>红色的衣服</color>…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761240205,
						761240206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "妌癸"
				},
				{
					"id": 761240205,
					"content": "哦哦，是王山厅当时的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761240207
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761240207,
					"content": "我也想起来了！是要我们精准打中所有穿着<color=#00E1FFFF>蓝色衣服</color>的竹人，但是不能打中穿着<color=#FF5E41FF>红色衣服</color>的竹人，对吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761240208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761240208,
					"content": "哈哈，一点儿没错！既是如此，那我也不必多费口舌了。让我见识一下你的剑术吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "妌癸"
				},
				{
					"id": 761240206,
					"content": "我知道规矩。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761240207
					]
				}
			]
